   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PG STWI - Textile management, Delhi, India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This planning grant application describes an intended cooperation     project between Indian textile production companies in the Delhi area (suppliers to KappAhl and Lindex), Swedish textile importers           KappAhl and Lindex, and Stockholm International Water Institute      (SIWI), with the aim to improve water management in textile           production processes.</narrative>
